  "about": [
    "Watchdog Blocks: sort 16 tiles into 4 groups of 4. One group per tier each day.",
    "tier 1 is the easiest group, tier 4 the trickiest. Tier 4 is always 'Towns in <county> County', built from property/data/games/towns.json.",
    "tiles: the words a puzzle may show for the group. also: other words that belong to the group but are not shown. Both count when the daily puzzle is checked for exactly one solution, so a tile that fits two groups is a fair red herring and never a trick.",
    "family groups (kind prefix or suffix) take their members from the real municipality names in towns.json; tiles must be a subset of those members (checked by property/tests/watchdog-games-contract.mjs).",
    "learn: where the results sheet sends players to read more. Glossary terms are fact-checked against official New Jersey sources."
